@template chatty

== career.missed
? tier>=colleague
- There you are! Everyone was asking where you'd got to. You all right? Honestly?

== worried.chief
? tier>=friend
- You saw Calder? Oh, {nick}. Tell me everything. Then I'll knock for you every morning.

== worried.captain
? tier>=friend
- The ready room! Look, whatever's going on, talk to me. I'm a good listener. Sometimes.   #serious

== worried.last
? tier>=friend
- I'm worried, {nick}. Properly. I'll knock for you in the morning. Every morning.   #serious

== career.up
? tier>=friend
- You were on shift! I told everyone. Well, three people. It's a start.   #funny

== farewell.eve
? tier>=friend
- I don't even know what to say, and I always know what to say. I'm so sorry.   #serious

== farewell.day
? tier>=friend
- Write. Every week. Long ones. I'll write back longer. You know I will.   #warm
